{"4312280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Is Guilty", "steam_appid": 4312280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is Guilty</strong> is a psychological horror job simulator where you work the night shift at a lonely drive-thru coffee stand. But you aren't just serving coffee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been blackmailed into finding a criminal. Someone in this city committed a crime, and they are coming through your drive-thru tonight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your government-issued database, a police scanner, and your own intuition, you must investigate every customer while maintaining your cover as a barista. But be careful identifying the wrong suspect has consequences, and something else is watching you from the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE NIGHT SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve donuts, pour coffee, and count change. Keep the customers happy so they lower their guard. Listen to their stories, check their license plates, and cross-reference their identities on your terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312280/extras/6e9480623174d1ff1b75e33bd96d8b16.poster.avif?t=1779814818\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312280/extras/6e9480623174d1ff1b75e33bd96d8b16.webm?t=1779814818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312280/extras/6e9480623174d1ff1b75e33bd96d8b16.mp4?t=1779814818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE INVESTIGATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, you receive a case file with clues about a suspect. The Watcher wants a name by 4 AM.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scan License Plates:</strong> Are they driving updated vehicles? Were they near the crime scene?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check Backgrounds:</strong> Do they have a criminal record? Are they lying about their job?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe Behavior:</strong> Is that nervousness, or just caffeine withdrawal? why is there blood on that steering wheel?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312280/extras/a15e05b63f29e925b49ffb570bedf49b.poster.avif?t=1779814818\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312280/extras/a15e05b63f29e925b49ffb570bedf49b.webm?t=1779814818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312280/extras/a15e05b63f29e925b49ffb570bedf49b.mp4?t=1779814818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PARANOIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are confined to your booth. Outside, the darkness is closing in. Weird figures appear in the distance. The power flickers. Are you the hunter, or the prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312280/extras/9546b17fc433bac83de4d5b4060b7380.poster.avif?t=1779814818\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312280/extras/9546b17fc433bac83de4d5b4060b7380.webm?t=1779814818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312280/extras/9546b17fc433bac83de4d5b4060b7380.mp4?t=1779814818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Simulation:</strong> Use a realistic coffee machine, cash register, and computer terminal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Escalating Cases:</i></strong><i> Each night brings a new crime and a new suspect. Stay sharp, the cases only get harder.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices matter. Will you turn in the guilty, help them escape, or get caught yourself?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> A tense, claustrophobic experience where the horror comes from what you <i>don't</i> see.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The coffee is hot. The night is long. And one of them... Is Guilty.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is Guilty</strong> is a psychological horror job simulator where you work the night shift at a lonely drive-thru coffee stand. But you aren't just serving coffee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been blackmailed into finding a criminal. Someone in this city committed a crime, and they are coming through your drive-thru tonight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your government-issued database, a police scanner, and your own intuition, you must investigate every customer while maintaining your cover as a barista. But be careful identifying the wrong suspect has consequences, and something else is watching you from the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE NIGHT SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve donuts, pour coffee, and count change. Keep the customers happy so they lower their guard. Listen to their stories, check their license plates, and cross-reference their identities on your terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas